{"kind":"report","text":"Ratified canonical changes-requested review da685415 via act 9068ede3 and revised the fan-out decision under existing promise 82b098b7. Retired rejected proposal 85f9060f, its completion report 13fd15c0 and dependent documentation request d04a4dee through 96b9b16c, 1bab726f and 5b780dd0. The satisfied review chain remains verified history.\n\nCurrent clean proposal e5b88d52 keeps the +10 percent relative fan-out target but withholds a formal pass until a versioned lane supplies its denominator correctly. It requires one explicit consecutive block at the contract-selected axis depth for widths 1, 8, 16, 64 and 256, with five warmups and 100 recorded repetitions per case. The distributions remain separate; adjacency removes the present hours-long structural separation without inventing pairing. Bounded child request 8ad57603 assigns Planner the versioned contract/perflane implementation on a fresh branch, with one unique one-base case, stable evidence identity, exact order/count tests, compatibility stop condition, full gates and independent review.\n\nThe proposal also closes the denominator hazard explicitly. A falling one-base denominator tightens allowed fan-out milliseconds, while a rising denominator loosens them; proportional fixed and incremental regressions can preserve the ratio and pass. Every retained result must therefore show the one-base median, signed median ratio and signed millisecond increment together. A passing ratio is not an overall latency guarantee. The separate fixed one-base 50 ms target remains an honest miss; request 8add6909 and Planner report 3bb86abd remain parked and unratified.\n\nClean successor documentation/evidence request e1ab6474 is assigned to Claude only after proposal adoption, the versioned lane landing and the current scale head settling. It requires the new contract-full run and both relative and millisecond reporting on the scale page. Fresh independent review request 88e58987 asks Claude to assess hazards A and B, Architecture, Security and Simplification before adoption.\n\nNo source, tracked documentation, active scale head, branch, Git ref or merge was changed. Remaining external steps are Claude review 88e58987, authorized ratifier adoption of e5b88d52, Planner routing and reviewed landing of 8ad57603, then evidence/docs request e1ab6474."}